{"a":[19,19],"h":"<p>19.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 83.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 50.2 50.2 60.7 60.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"50.2 67.4\" y=\"20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> işte bu ıhtar, bu inzarları ihtiva eden bu âyetler<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 30.7 30.7 42.0 42.0 51.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 51.0 57.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bir tezkire - bir öğüd, ve nasîhati tazammum eden bir tebliğdir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"248\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 248.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 21.7 28.6 35.3 35.3 62.3 62.3 69.0 69.0 69.0 75.7 93.0 104.3 104.3 111.7 111.7 127.6 136.6 149.3 149.3 156.0 171.7 178.6 178.6 185.3 205.6 205.6 216.0 225.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"42.0 42.0 75.7 127.6 136.6 149.3 171.7 185.3 216.0 225.0 231.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Artık dileyen rabbına bir yol tutar - o günün şiddet ve dehşetinden korunmak ve rabbına selâmetle irmek için iyman ve itaat ve husni amelle Allaha tekarrüb etmeğe çalışır.</p>"}